======================================================================
  3. limma-voom
======================================================================
  saved: results/05_compare/voom_trend.png
voom estimates the mean-variance trend on log-CPM and turns it into a
 precision weight per observation. Then ordinary limma (with empirical Bayes)
 applies -- the whole limma toolbox (contrasts, random effects, camera) opens up.
limma-voom: FDR<5% = 5190 
  saved: results/05_compare/voom_SA.png

